{"id":"n15640-7-5","stage":3,"title":"비치다 · 露面","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n15640-7-5-1","ko":"나 지금 네 회사 앞인데 지나는 길에 잠깐 얼굴 좀 비치고 가려고.","zh":"我现在就在你公司门口，顺路过来想稍微露个面就走。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"나","meaning":"我","explanation":"나：我","readings":[{"term":"나","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60931","senseId":"1","lemma":"나","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"지금","meaning":"现在","explanation":"지금：现在","readings":[{"term":"지금","audio":"/audio/df159f47a890ff655039.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62522","senseId":"1","lemma":"지금","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"네","meaning":"“너의(你的)”的缩略语。","explanation":"네：“너의(你的)”的缩略语。","readings":[{"term":"네","audio":"/audio/1c0ddfd0050938404c35.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"84427","senseId":"1","lemma":"네","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"회사","meaning":"公司，企业，会社","explanation":"회사：公司，企业，会社","readings":[{"term":"회사","audio":"/audio/a109dcd7f6f11c2e1703.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"31668","senseId":"1","lemma":"회사","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"앞인데","meaning":"前，前面","explanation":"앞：前，前面；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；ㄴ데：先交代背景，再引出后文的转折、补充、请求或问题。","readings":[{"term":"앞","audio":"/audio/ec1a6b96ce688b70368d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"88648","senseId":"1","lemma":"앞","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"지나는","meaning":"过，经过","explanation":"지나다：过，经过；-는：将前面的动作或状态转为修饰名词的形式。","readings":[{"term":"지나다","audio":"/audio/7d68e3b7dc1c001cae3b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"82142","senseId":"3","lemma":"지나다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"길에","meaning":"路上","explanation":"길：路上；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"길","audio":"/audio/d72c8434585436678000.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"59251","senseId":"9","lemma":"길","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"잠깐","meaning":"一下，暂时地","explanation":"잠깐：一下，暂时地","readings":[{"term":"잠깐",